       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RANDOMNUMBERDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SEED-VALUE PIC 9(4) VALUE 42.
       01 RANDOM-VALUE PIC 9V9(6).
       01 SCALED-VALUE PIC 9(3).
       01 I PIC 9(1).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE RANDOM-VALUE = FUNCTION RANDOM(SEED-VALUE)
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               COMPUTE RANDOM-VALUE = FUNCTION RANDOM
               COMPUTE SCALED-VALUE = RANDOM-VALUE * 100
               DISPLAY "ROLL " I ": " SCALED-VALUE
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
